language-model-applications/)\n*   [](https://github.com/genai-security-project/)\n*   [](https://owasp.org/slack/invite)\n*   [](https://www.youtube.com/@GenAISecurityProject)\n\n*   GEN AI SECURITY\n*   resources\n\n*   Whitepapers/Guides\n\nAgentic AI – Threats and Mitigations\n------------------------------------\n\n*   February 17, 2025\n\nAbout\n-----\n\nAgentic AI represents an advancement in autonomous systems, increasingly enabled by large language models (LLMs) and generative AI. While agentic AI predates modern LLMs, their integration with generative AI has significantly expanded their scale, capabilities, and associated risks. This document is the first in a series of guides from the OWASP Agentic Security Initiative (ASI) to provide a threat-model-based reference of emerging agentic threats and discuss mitigations.\n\n![](https://genai.owasp.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Agentic-AI-Threats-and-Mitigations_v1.0-Cover.png)\n\n[Download](https://genai.owasp.org/download/45674/?tmstv=1739819891)\n\nAdditional Resources\n--------------------\n\n![](https://genai.owasp.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/genai-data-security-best-practices-v2-part2-232x300.jpg)\n\n*   November 16, 2026\n*   [Resources](https://genai.owasp.org/category/resources/)\n\n[\n\nGenAI Data Security Best Practices v2 – Part2\n---------------------------------------------\n\n](https://genai.owasp.org/resource/genai-data-security-best-practices-v2-part2/)\n\n![](https://genai.owasp.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Securing-Agentic-Applications-v2-232x300.jpg)\n\n*   November 10, 2026\n*   [Resources](https://genai.owasp.org/category/resources/)\n\n[\n\nSecuring Agentic Applications V2\n--------------------------------\n\n](https://genai.owasp.org/resource/securing-agentic-applications-v2/)\n\n![](https://genai.owasp.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Cover-GenAi-Data-Securty-Best-Practices-Part-1-232x300.jpg)\n\n*   November 2, 2026\n*   [Resources](https://genai.owasp.org/category/resources/)\n\n